---
description: Best practices for FastAPI 0.116 (Pydantic v2, SQLAlchemy 2.0)
globs: */backend/app/**/*.py,*/backend/tests/**/*.py,*/backend/main.py
---

- Use Pydantic v2 models and validators; avoid legacy pydantic v1 APIs
- Prefer typing.Annotated for Depends and parameter metadata
- Keep endpoints async def; avoid blocking I/O on the event loop
- Manage settings with pydantic-settings; load secrets from env
- Structure by domain: api, schemas, models, crud, services, core
- Use response_model on routes; return DTOs instead of dicts
- SQLAlchemy 2.0: async engine plus async_sessionmaker; 2.0-style queries
- Transactions: use async with session.begin; single unit-of-work per request
- Alembic: autogenerate migrations; do not rewrite history
- Security: bcrypt passwords, JWT via python-jose; configure CORS explicitly
- Testing: pytest and pytest-asyncio; httpx AsyncClient for integration tests

